flowchart TB
    U[Customer / Seller / Admin] --> FE[ReactJS + Vite]
    FE --> API[Spring Boot REST API]
    API --> SEC[Security / JWT]
    API --> MOD[Modular Monolith]
    MOD --> SVC[Service Layer + Transactions]
    SVC --> REPO[Spring Data JPA Repositories]
    REPO --> DB[(MariaDB / MySQL)]
    SVC --> AI[External AI API]
    SVC --> FILES[External Image/File Storage]
    DB --- FLYWAY[Flyway migrations]
